tured on Artz Friday with Tezos Commons."},{"text":"Paraxeno on X","link":"https://x.com/paraxenod"},{"text":"Paraxeno's website","link":"https://sites.google.com/view/plektaniart/"},{"text":"The recording is at radio.tezoscommons.org.","link":"https://radio.tezoscommons.org"},{"text":"The voice is Paraxeno's, from Nowhere Else, a production by Skllzrmy with music by Yoeshi.","link":"https://objkt.com/tokens/hicetnunc/885535"},{"text":"The walls, dome and floor are painted with Paint with Paraxeno, her own tool.","link":"https://objkt.com/tokens/KT1UTDzQvKNau6KUMKomsNPaSYrLxuRJ35HK/1"}],"poster":"media/paraxeno/poster.jpg"}